    "details": {
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 3
      },
      "disable": "<p>@Check[type:occultism|dc:25|name: To Banish Haunt|traits:complex,haunt] (expert) To Banish Haunt,</p>\n<p>@Check[type:religion|dc:25|name: To Banish Haunt|traits:complex,haunt] (expert) To Banish Haunt,</p>\n<p>@Check[type:perception|dc:20|name:To Notice Increasing Stink of Rotten Flesh|traits:complex,haunt] (trained)To Notice Increasing Stink of Rotten Flesh</p>",
      "description": "<p style=\"text-align:justify\">You see Aldern, sweaty, filthy, and wild-eyed, digging away at the stone f loor of this room with a pickaxe. With each swing, he grunts out two words: “For you.” You knows that Aldern is speaking of you. As the vision ends, Aldern breaks through into the room beyond, and a horde of shrieking ghouls rises up to pull him into the darkness below. A moment later, the ghouls turn their lambent eyes upon you and their clawed hands, dripping with blood and tattered flesh reach for you...</p>",
      "reset": "<p>The haunt automatically resets after 1 day until the supernatural fungus in B37 is dealt with, even if the haunt was previously disabled.</p>",
      "routine": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Obsessed Haunt:</strong> This haunt affects the target of Aldern Foxglove's obsession, which attracts Vorel Foxglmre's own obsession with eternal life. If no creature in a group of creatures is haunted by obsession, then this haunt may&nbsp;target anyone.</p>"
    },
